{"schemaVersion":1,"id":229,"sections":[{"id":"358002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20546],"start":0,"count":16},{"id":"358002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20547],"start":16,"count":20}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:1","scriptId":20546,"text":"根据波西娅地图的指示，我们来到了一座废弃的小镇。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:2","scriptId":20546,"text":"于是我们便以这个小镇为中心展开探索工作。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:3","scriptId":20546,"text":"“噫……这里好脏啊，而且到处都是白茫茫的蜘蛛丝。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":746,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:4","scriptId":20546,"text":"“有蜘蛛丝就对了，说明我们离目标很接近。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":577,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:5","scriptId":20546,"text":"“整个小镇该不会都是狼蛛的巢穴吧……突然感觉心里有些发毛……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":577,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:6","scriptId":20546,"text":"“狼蛛生态和一般蜘蛛不同，它们可以用脚吐丝，所以这些蛛丝其实是它们的足迹。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":577,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:7","scriptId":20546,"text":"“呃，佩妮知道的可真多。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:8","scriptId":20546,"text":"（本来还想炫耀一下的呢……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":588,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:9","scriptId":20546,"text":"“只是做了些事前调查而已……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":588,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:10","scriptId":20546,"text":"“那只要跟着这些丝就能找到目标了吧~可以拿报酬了啊~”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":740,"right":588,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:11","scriptId":20546,"text":"“理论上来说应该是这样，不过世事无绝对。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:12","scriptId":20546,"text":"这时，佩妮突然摆出了战斗的架势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:13","scriptId":20546,"text":"“三点钟方向发现可疑的阴影。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:14","scriptId":20546,"text":"维卡停顿了一会儿，接着她叫到。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:15","scriptId":20546,"text":"“疑似机甲狼蛛！但还混有原核体。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-PROLOGUE:20546:16","scriptId":20546,"text":"“立刻出击！捉活的！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:1","scriptId":20547,"text":"一场恶战之后，原核体被尽数消灭，但机甲狼蛛却逃跑了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:2","scriptId":20547,"text":"我们继续向前推进之后发现了一个可能是狼蛛巢穴的地方。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:3","scriptId":20547,"text":"这里原本可能是一栋民宅，但由于蛛丝的层层包裹，房屋的形状已经面目全非了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:4","scriptId":20547,"text":"“这里应该是刚才那只机甲狼蛛的巢穴，但我们攻占了这里之后应该被它放弃了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:5","scriptId":20547,"text":"房屋的外缘已经被钢制的丝给全包裹，除此以外还有一个个椭圆形的白色茧状物。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:6","scriptId":20547,"text":"“这茧很大啊，竟然有半个成年人大小。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:7","scriptId":20547,"text":"“如果是蜘蛛茧的话，一种是幼虫的茧，另一种则是食物。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:8","scriptId":20547,"text":"“要切开来看看吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:9","scriptId":20547,"text":"维卡蹲在其中一个茧的旁边，手里握着狩猎小刀。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":743,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:10","scriptId":20547,"text":"“哎呦……感觉很恶心啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":596,"right":743,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":579,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:11","scriptId":20547,"text":"“虽然是感觉有点恶心，但里面的东西确实需要确认一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":579,"right":743,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:12","scriptId":20547,"text":"于是，维卡开始切割虫茧……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":579,"right":743,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:13","scriptId":20547,"text":"从维卡吃力的动作来看，这虫茧坚固异常。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":579,"right":743,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":602,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:14","scriptId":20547,"text":"“呼……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":602,"right":743,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:15","scriptId":20547,"text":"维卡完全割开虫茧，里面有一只正在孵化中的狼蛛幼崽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":602,"right":743,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:16","scriptId":20547,"text":"“奇怪……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":602,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:17","scriptId":20547,"text":"看到狼蛛幼崽之后，佩妮发出了略带疑惑的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":602,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:18","scriptId":20547,"text":"“有什么奇怪的吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:19","scriptId":20547,"text":"“这狼蛛的机械化程度太惊人了……总觉得怪怪的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358002-EPILOGUE:20547:20","scriptId":20547,"text":"“在这里纠结也没什么用，带上幼崽回去给波西娅看看吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-11.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
